<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>PGA<sp/>DAC-ADC<sp/>External<sp/>Loopback<sp/>{#EXAMPLES_DRIVERS_PGA_EX1_DAC_ADC_EXT_LOOPBACK}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">[TOC]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Introduction</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\cond<sp/>F28E12x<sp/>||<sp/>MCPC029</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>example<sp/>generates<sp/>800<sp/>mV<sp/>using<sp/>the<sp/>CMPSSDAC<sp/>output.<sp/>CMPSSLITE<sp/>is<sp/>used<sp/>route<sp/>the<sp/>low<sp/>DAC<sp/>output<sp/>to<sp/>an<sp/>external<sp/>pin<sp/>to<sp/>be<sp/>used<sp/>as<sp/>an<sp/>external<sp/>DAC.<sp/>The<sp/>output<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>CMPSSLITE<sp/>DACL<sp/>is<sp/>externally<sp/>connected<sp/>to<sp/>PGA<sp/>for<sp/>2x<sp/>gain<sp/>amplification.<sp/>It<sp/>uses<sp/>two<sp/>ADC<sp/>channels<sp/>to<sp/>sample<sp/>the<sp/>CMPSSDAC<sp/>output<sp/>and<sp/>the<sp/>amplified<sp/>voltage<sp/>output<sp/>from<sp/>PGA.<sp/>The<sp/>ADC<sp/>is<sp/>connected<sp/>internally<sp/>to<sp/>these<sp/>signals.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\endcond</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\cond<sp/>F28P55x<sp/>||<sp/>F28P551x</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>example<sp/>generates<sp/>400<sp/>mV<sp/>using<sp/>the<sp/>DAC<sp/>output<sp/>(it<sp/>uses<sp/>an<sp/>internal<sp/>voltage<sp/>reference).<sp/>The<sp/>output<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>DAC<sp/>is<sp/>externally<sp/>connected<sp/>to<sp/>PGA2<sp/>for<sp/>a<sp/>2x<sp/>gain<sp/>amplification.<sp/>It<sp/>uses<sp/>two<sp/>ADC<sp/>channels<sp/>to<sp/>sample<sp/>the<sp/>DAC<sp/>output<sp/>and<sp/>the<sp/>amplified<sp/>voltage<sp/>output<sp/>from<sp/>PGA2.<sp/>The<sp/>ADC<sp/>is<sp/>connected<sp/>to<sp/>these<sp/>signals<sp/>internally.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\endcond</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Watch<sp/><sp/>Variables</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>dacResult<sp/>-<sp/>The<sp/>DAC<sp/>output<sp/>voltage.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>pgaResult<sp/>-<sp/>The<sp/>amplified<sp/>DAC<sp/>voltage.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>pgaGain<sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>The<sp/>ratio<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>amplified<sp/>DAC<sp/>voltage<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>original<sp/>DAC<sp/>output.<sp/>This<sp/>should<sp/>always<sp/>read<sp/>a<sp/>value<sp/>of<sp/>~2.0.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>External<sp/>Connections</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\cond<sp/>F28E12x</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Connect<sp/>CMPSSLITE_DACL_OUT<sp/>(Analog<sp/>Pin<sp/>A0)<sp/>to<sp/>PGA1_INP1<sp/>(Analog<sp/>Pin<sp/>A11)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Connect<sp/>PGA1_INM1<sp/>(Analog<sp/>Pin<sp/>A4)<sp/>to<sp/>GND</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\endcond</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\cond<sp/>F28P55x<sp/>||<sp/>F28P551x</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Connect<sp/>DACA_OUT<sp/>(Analog<sp/>Pin<sp/>A0)<sp/>to<sp/>PGA2_INP<sp/>(Analog<sp/>Pin<sp/>A2).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Connect<sp/>PGA1_INM<sp/>(Analog<sp/>Pin<sp/>A3)<sp/>to<sp/>GND</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\endcond</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
